    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1078">

                <pb facs="1107" n="987" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg987"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Hutchinson to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-06-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 22, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 432.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm my cablegram to
                    the Department, dated the 20th instant, and reading as follows: [Printed
                    ante.]</p>
                <p>As the exceptions taken by the company have been overruled, the case will be
                    proceeded with.</p>
                <p>I inclose copy and translation of the decision.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norman
                    Hutchinson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1078-a1.xml" xpointer="d1078-a1"/>
            </div>
